some call it a second front in the  ukrainian war the fight to control the  narrative while silenski has reached  audiences around the world with his  nightly speeches russia is also vying  for attention with a well-funded  propaganda campaign dw's head of  fact-checking josh aviva explains why  you should be careful when dealing with  images and information about this war  it's all just a fake  here ukrainian actors are supposedly  staging a russian attack on the civilian  population of ukraine  well at least that's what the russian  embassy in madrid claimed in a tweet  if the atrocities of the russian  military do not exist they must be  invented it says the video went viral  with more than 1.2 million views but  what does it really show  it is indeed a production but it's quite  different from what the russian embassy  purported it showed it's a film shoot  for the ukrainian war movie region of  heroes which is being shot in the kiev  suburb of hostimal  here you can see some pictures from the  set we found on social media the clip is  behind the scenes from the shoot as the  producer of the film confirmed to us  so there's nothing fake to see here but  a feature film and the russian embassy  tweet was deleted  russia's propaganda seeks to justify the  war and its consequences to the russian  audience by portraying the west as  inferior and lately we've seen a shift  towards new topics like the energy  crisis in europe and the sanctions  against russia  this report by russian state television  shows a food bank in germany whose  number of customers has doubled since  the war began  the report also claims that germans  linked the decline in their standard of  living to the sanctions against russia  however we found the original video from  the bavarian broadcasting service br  about the food bank in nuremberg it does  report on an increased demand as a  result of increased inflation due to the  war but not a single word about the  sanctions against russia  some things are only changed slightly  there or taken out of context others are  freely invented and are almost comical  like this claim from russian state  television  in the main news show the presenter  tells us that bacteria scabies mites  fleas and even lice are spreading in  europe right now because people don't  wash themselves anymore because of the  energy crisis and that europe is rolling  back to the middle ages as the anchor  says  neither at the national level or on  european level we could find even vague  evidence to support this wild claim  and the european center for disease  prevention and control ecdc confirmed to  us  there's no significant increase in such  infestations in the european union  probably the most remarkable  misstatement of this war however comes  from the russian president himself  the russian army does not strike at any  civilian objects he says  however this statement is in stark  contrast to reality  the massacres in butcher the bombing of  the maripole hospital  the use of cluster bombs and hakif and  so many more the list of attacks on  civilians in ukraine is long and the  case is well documented  in this case the facts contradict putin  nevertheless propaganda always almost  achieves one goal it sows doubt  it has been effective so far for russia  and as long as this war continues the  lies likely won't stop  you
 

